{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01804","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难 · 薛能","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处力堪殚？人心险万端。\n藏山难测度，暗水自波澜。\n对面如千里，回肠似七盘。\n已经吴坂困，欲向鴈门难。\n南北诚须泣，高深不可干。\n无因善行止，车辙得平安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}